ass=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #ff9900; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">8 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Event</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20081227092026&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Magical_Torch_9fe85c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a magical torch <span class=\"p-attributes\">(speed +25)</span> <span class=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 18.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Light all important locations given to you by Lucius before one of the basins stops burning.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lucius\">Lucius</a> can give you one during <a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a>. It will vanish at the end of November. Cannot be seen in the <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">Market</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Was first seen in the 2 Test Servers preceding the first Lightbearer Event (the test servers of Summer Update 2009 and Autumn Patch 2009).\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Speed_and_shielding\">Speed and shielding</span></h4>\n<p>On the test server of the Summer Update 2009, this item had a speed bonus of 50 and a defense value of 38. This was reduced (during that test server) to a speed bonus of 25 and a def of 25 because many testers agreed it could be abused. A defense value of 38 would mean a shield as strong as a Great Shield (dropped by Massacre, Morgaroth, Ferumbras and Ghazbaran) for free!\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/a-pirates-death-to-me\">A Pirate's Death to Me</a></li><li>Extra Slot</li><li>Great Shield</li><li>Illumination</li><li>Light Sources</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lightbringer%27s%20Basin\">Lightbringer's Basin</a></li><li>Other Objects</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li>Speed</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Market%20%28Object%29\">The Market (Object)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/True%20Lightbearer\">True Lightbearer</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["the-lightbearer"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-lightbearer","quest":"The Lightbearer","step":"0-2","n":3,"title":"Pedir a tocha","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":32892,"y":31094,"z":7,"label":"Lucius"}]},{"slug":"the-lightbearer","quest":"The Lightbearer","step":"0-4","n":5,"title":"Como funciona a